{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/Madness-Afloat-Steam-pagev2.png?t=1753273253\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/fd23df100bd26d36e25a5f3388503382.avif?t=1753273253\" /></div>In Madness Afloat, 1\u20134 players pilot cursed steamships through nightmarish sea routes haunted by mutated wrecks, eldritch shrines and sanity-shredding anomalies. Every voyage is short, but every decision may leave a scar.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/steam1.gif?t=1753273253\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/522c8e6b6f59a836ce59d14c4a68ec3b.avif?t=1753273253\" /></div>Haul volatile cargo through hostile waters. Each crate, be it fragile, cursed, hot/cold or explosive, must be snapped into your ship\u2019s grid. Misplace one or take too many hits, and you risk chain reactions, melting sanity or a hold-wide detonation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/SteamGifs2.gif?t=1753273253\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/e33c2d9af069b106dd9da8d4e1466e87.avif?t=1753273253\" /></div>Sanity is shared across your crew. As fear mounts, hallucinations distort targeting, vision, even commands. Ride the Edge for brief clarity and power or tumble into madness. Shrine bargains, officer traumas and cursed cargo echo across dives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/SteamGifs3.gif?t=1753273253\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/285c4932b1ff07aa448487ca3f78f7b3.avif?t=1753273253\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each 20\u201330 minute dive leaves lasting marks. Ships evolve with new hull modules and systems. Named officers, drawn from rival factions, gain traits, traumas and unique abilities. Your standing with these factions affects who will join you and who might turn away. Boons stack. Debts accrue. You\u2019ll return stronger, but not unscarred. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/CharactersV4.png?t=1753273253\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/516dbbf3a3a0b59dc756a6f7d97f9e21.avif?t=1753273253\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or with a full crew, anyone can cover the essentials. Deeper coordination unlocks role synergies, kit combos and multi-ship strategies for high-tier anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/1d6439a38f5c9c99b865e302bf2966d6.avif?t=1753273253\" /></div> <br>In an alternate 1899, the Polynesian archipelago of Tuva\u2019i is unraveling. Imperial ambition has awakened something ancient. Face warring factions, forbidden shrines and whispering seas in a world where every storm remembers and some voices never stop calling.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3095020?t=1753273253","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3095020?t=1753273253","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753273253","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753273253","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/Madness-Afloat-Steam-pagev2.png?t=1753273253\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/fd23df100bd26d36e25a5f3388503382.avif?t=1753273253\" /></div>In Madness Afloat, 1\u20134 players pilot cursed steamships through nightmarish sea routes haunted by mutated wrecks, eldritch shrines and sanity-shredding anomalies. Every voyage is short, but every decision may leave a scar.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/steam1.gif?t=1753273253\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/522c8e6b6f59a836ce59d14c4a68ec3b.avif?t=1753273253\" /></div>Haul volatile cargo through hostile waters. Each crate, be it fragile, cursed, hot/cold or explosive, must be snapped into your ship\u2019s grid. Misplace one or take too many hits, and you risk chain reactions, melting sanity or a hold-wide detonation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/SteamGifs2.gif?t=1753273253\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/e33c2d9af069b106dd9da8d4e1466e87.avif?t=1753273253\" /></div>Sanity is shared across your crew. As fear mounts, hallucinations distort targeting, vision, even commands. Ride the Edge for brief clarity and power or tumble into madness. Shrine bargains, officer traumas and cursed cargo echo across dives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/SteamGifs3.gif?t=1753273253\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/285c4932b1ff07aa448487ca3f78f7b3.avif?t=1753273253\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each 20\u201330 minute dive leaves lasting marks. Ships evolve with new hull modules and systems. Named officers, drawn from rival factions, gain traits, traumas and unique abilities. Your standing with these factions affects who will join you and who might turn away. Boons stack. Debts accrue. You\u2019ll return stronger, but not unscarred. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/CharactersV4.png?t=1753273253\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/516dbbf3a3a0b59dc756a6f7d97f9e21.avif?t=1753273253\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or with a full crew, anyone can cover the essentials. Deeper coordination unlocks role synergies, kit combos and multi-ship strategies for high-tier anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/extras/1d6439a38f5c9c99b865e302bf2966d6.avif?t=1753273253\" /></div> <br>In an alternate 1899, the Polynesian archipelago of Tuva\u2019i is unraveling. Imperial ambition has awakened something ancient. Face warring factions, forbidden shrines and whispering seas in a world where every storm remembers and some voices never stop calling.</p>","developers":["Dynamic Box"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095020/header.jpg?t=1753273253","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Madness Afloat","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-6300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1650 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</stron