ng>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://madnessafloat.dynamicbox.net"}